{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 28","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_28\">Problem 28</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 28\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On the same set of axes are drawn the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84cea4f7bfc5284747e737af0d1a25e64afdd47e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"20\" /> and the graph of the equation obtained by replacing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/52969fdeeb90f7e24cd2a2f1a6cfe124776fee2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> in the given equation. \nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/9/d09016ae7d4bb0ccd869b43b3da544e9bacc08e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a5061ac0ea7f3b0c9eb6387005ae6c28eac6bfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> these two graphs intersect: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/9/819a9e23ed750418ea5b1307875927cf3389e52f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{in two points, one on the x-axis and one on the y-axis}\\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{in one point located on neither axis}\\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{only at the origin}\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{in one point on the x-axis}\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{in one point on the y-axis}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"98\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replacing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff0f5de19e70a0c97c8330b86e0289e27bfd025.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"28\" height=\"11\" /> we have the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f83c10b608ed1e294dc22317e609d75d78894850.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = a(-x)^2 + b(-x) + c = ax^2 - bx+c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"314\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>We can plug in simple values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f73d811eca6419d9c9a27423331d71ff06eb957.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> for convenient drawing. For example, we can graph <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/9/959659297b6f86296feb3bd58267d2c4ed55d6ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+2x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecde4f1f160189629f2f46a659876e0e31aa33cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-2x+1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" /> We see that the parabolas intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/f/11f2a735c2092f11c7dc6f67a02d5afd74c33c89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, 1),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"18\" /> which is on the y-axis.\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/3/9637ded1c3fcafb638e9de07271242a795f4043c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"42\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME\" title=\"1955 AHSME\">1955 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1955 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1955\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a 